0-12T15:06:24Z","closed_at":"2026-09-08T17:14:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123291","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123291","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123291.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123291.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-08T17:14:11Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Should fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123286\r\n- Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121161\r\n\r\nIn other words, should fix a bug where a thread would be assigned the \"main thread\" ID even though it didn't claim main-thread status.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`Thread::id_counter` is currently compiled into the binary as `0`, and only set to `1` on static initialization.\r\n`Thread::caller_id` initializes as `Thread::id_counter.increment();`, i.e. with a dependence to `id_counter`.\r\n\r\nSince `caller_id` is `thread_local`, C++ does not guarantee `id_counter` is initialized first. If a thread happens to access `caller_id` before `id_counter`'s initialization is complete, it will read `0` and thus `caller_id` is set to `1`.\r\n\r\n~While this PR does not guarantee a fix (`constinit` would), it should be a practical guarantee since compilers are hungry to constant fold even at `-O0`.~\r\nEdit: Apparently this is wrong; this IS a guaranteed fix due to `[basic.start.static]`.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123291/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123291/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}